we really enjoyed the game!! Your spirits are amazing and always consider us first when we had any contacts. Swampybarg ganbate!!"},{"game_id":75,"givento":"JPN W DARUMASAN","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":76,"givento":"SGP Club Women's","cat1":1,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":8,"comments":null},{"game_id":147,"givento":"SGP Club Women's","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null}],"spiritreceived":[{"game_id":62,"givenby":"Singapore Women's","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":1,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"Want to commend team for keeping high spirits throughout the whole game. \r\nBody contact more than we would have liked from a few players - pushing off on players \r\nFair-mindedness : felt that there was more than 1 instance where we felt that our perspective was not heard when discussing calls (that eventually went in opponents favor)"},{"game_id":55,"givenby":"PHI W Binibinis","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":3,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":73,"givenby":"CHN W Shirahama Mulan","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":74,"givenby":"JPN W HUCK","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":68,"givenby":"Australia Women's","cat1":1,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"Great game overall! WE LOVE YOUR COACH!!! big hearts for him \r\n\r\nWe would like for both teams to use more hand signals on a stoppage and indicate early and wait for the appropriate time to call a secondary call (eg picks and injuries). We hope that your players will not be shy to speak up about any level of contact that is not acceptable to them :) "},{"game_id":47,"givenby":"JPN W SWAMPYBARG","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":75,"givenby":"JPN W DARUMASAN","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":"Thank you for good game!"},{"game_id":76,"givenby":"SGP Club Women's","cat1":1,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":9,"comments":"Great positivity from the team! We felt that the hand signals could have been clearer on the brick call, contested fouls and injury substitutions (tapping the ground), but we appreciated how the team was very receptive to feedback. "},{"game_id":147,"givenby":"SGP Club Women's","cat1":2,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":1,"total":8,"comments":"There was improvement from our previous game! Still some confusing hand signals (for eg signalling retract when it was a contest, not signalling brick calls). We also felt that there was a significant amount of contact that could have been avoided. "}],"spiritstats":{"games":9},"spirittotal":{"total":88}}